##  Dataset

The project uses the **Labeled Faces in the Wild (LFW)** dataset provided by Scikit-learn.

The dataset is loaded using:

```python
people = fetch_lfw_people(
    min_faces_per_person=20,
    resize=0.7
)
```

The parameter `min_faces_per_person=20` means that only people with at least 20 available face images are included.

The program displays the shape of the dataset:

```python
print(people.data.shape)
print(people.target.shape)
```

---

